WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.063
This table condenses the brief's
what-must-resolve-where table.

2
00:00:04.063 --> 00:00:06.149
The full version is in the backup.

3
00:00:06.149 --> 00:00:11.445
The HR middleware, if it runs as Azure
Functions or Logic Apps Standard joined to a

4
00:00:11.445 --> 00:00:14.211
virtual network, resolves the Fusion host,

5
00:00:14.211 --> 00:00:17.925
Graph and sign-in publicly,
through the agency's resolver.

6
00:00:17.925 --> 00:00:21.885
Its evidence store and key vault
sit behind private endpoints,

7
00:00:21.885 --> 00:00:26.225
so it needs a linked private zone, or
a resolver that forwards to Azure.

8
00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:30.505
Microsoft documents an app
setting, WEBSITE_DNS_SERVER,

9
00:00:30.505 --> 00:00:33.762
for pointing the app at
your own DNS server.

10
00:00:33.762 --> 00:00:39.250
Lifecycle Workflow extensions run in
Consumption Logic Apps, the multitenant kind.

11
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.525
As an inference, they can
reach only public names.

12
00:00:42.525 --> 00:00:47.531
The provisioning agent resolves domain
controller locator records internally,

13
00:00:47.531 --> 00:00:50.475
and Microsoft's relay and
sign-in names publicly.

14
00:00:50.475 --> 00:00:54.997
On-premises systems reach cloud private
names by forwarding from the Grid,

15
00:00:54.997 --> 00:00:59.009
meaning the Infoblox appliances,
to each cloud's inbound endpoint:

16
00:00:59.009 --> 00:01:03.313
an address inside the cloud network
that accepts queries from outside.

17
00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:09.062
Fusion users on Oracle's private access
still get Fusion's public DNS answer.

18
00:01:09.062 --> 00:01:12.626
A Lambda function in a VPC,
a virtual private cloud,

19
00:01:12.626 --> 00:01:16.712
reaches agency APIs through
an outbound rule to the Grid.

20
00:01:16.712 --> 00:01:22.726
And vCenter and ESXi need forward and
reverse records, A and PTR, in the Grid.

21
00:01:22.726 --> 00:01:33.796
Sources: Research brief §8, What must
resolve where, and the sources in each row:

22
00:01:33.796 --> 00:01:42.231
Microsoft Learn [S2, S4, S4b (excerpt),
S8 (excerpt), S11b (excerpt),

23
00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:50.314
S13–S15 (excerpts)]; Oracle [S20–S24];
AWS [S29, S30]; Broadcom [S36];

24
00:01:50.314 --> 00:01:58.990
Book 08 Ch07 and Ch08;
